  "title": "手机上连着三条消息",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hinana.paper",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hinana.paper",
    "idolId": "hinana",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……消息，是雛菜。）",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "『制作人现在在做什么？』",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……出什么事了吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "『我在事务所整理资料，怎么了？』",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "话说，这个时间雛菜应该在上课吧……",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……回得好快……！",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "『雛菜前阵子拿着的那张讲义，不在事务所吗？』",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……前阵子……是说进路调查那个啊！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "雛菜，还没交上去吗……！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "『稍等，我找找看。』",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──哦，太好了，找到了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊——……折痕压得可真整齐啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "『讲义找到了哦。』",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "『真的？太好了。』",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "『那今天去拿哦♡被骂了，说要快点交♡』",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈啊…………",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "………………还没写啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "───雛菜。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "想好写什么了吗？",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "得守住期限啊。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          },
          {
            "label": "下次别再弄丢了。",
            "nextNodeId": "140"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～～～……还在想～？",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "不过总觉得，写什么好像都会挨骂～",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "雛菜按自己的想法写的话，一定",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……怎么了，雛菜有想写的东西吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "105"
      },
      "105": {
        "id": "105",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～？可是反正会被说重写吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "106"
      },
      "106": {
        "id": "106",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "就算那样，只要是雛菜好好想过的结果，不就好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "107"
      },
      "107": {
        "id": "107",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "……这样～？",
        "nextNodeId": "108"
      },
      "108": {
        "id": "108",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "…………这样啊～"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊～……",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "说得也是呢～……",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "如果雛菜说什么都想不出来，那就写这个交上去也行。",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "诶～！可以吗～……？",
        "nextNodeId": "124"
      },
      "124": {
        "id": "124",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，这种事本来就是为了商量才有的。",
        "nextNodeId": "125"
      },
      "125": {
        "id": "125",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "呼～嗯……",
        "nextNodeId": "126"
      },
      "126": {
        "id": "126",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "那就是说，雛菜按自己的想法写也可以～",
        "nextNodeId": "127"
      },
      "127": {
        "id": "127",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那当然。这是雛菜自己的事。",
        "nextNodeId": "128"
      },
      "128": {
        "id": "128",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "……什么嘛，这样啊～"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "没有弄丢哦～？只是放在事务所而已！",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……是重要的东西，就要好好管理。",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "可是，是制作人帮我找到的呀？",
        "nextNodeId": "143"
      },
      "143": {
        "id": "143",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这次是。不能每次都这样……",
        "nextNodeId": "144"
      },
      "144": {
        "id": "144",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "可是，要是找不到，每次都会一起帮我找吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "145"
      },
      "145": {
        "id": "145",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………嘛，是啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "146"
      },
      "146": {
        "id": "146",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "啊哈～！果然是这样呢～",
        "nextNodeId": "147"
      },
      "147": {
        "id": "147",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "和雛菜想的一样～！"
      }
    }
  },
